    "preamble": "Wpms/2233/2019 on 6 August, 2019",
    "facts": "The petitioner was running a meat shop at Cholli Sahabuddinpur Tehsil Roorkee, District Haridwar since 02.08.2014. According to the petitioner, he had a valid licence and No Objection Certificate from the concerned authority for running the meat shop under the Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006. Now it is not being renewed by the respondents, for which no reasons have been assigned.",
